# AI Studio skill project layout

```
skills/           # One folder per skill
agents/           # Lean Studio prompts
docs/             # Authoring maps (system, demo, mcp-index) — committed
docs/private/     # Local notes — gitignored
.workspace/       # Local /workspace/ mirror (data gitignored)
dist/skills/      # Optional zips
.cursor/rules/    # Cursor authoring rules
```

Keep `.gitignore` ignoring `.workspace/*` except README. Keep `.cursorignore`
on heavy `docs/**/*.pdf` and `.workspace/**`. Never commit customer data under
`.workspace/`. Test skills against `.workspace/` with `--workspace` when supported.
